# Ghalta, Stampede Tyrant {5}{G}{G}{G}, 12/12 Trample: "When Ghalta enters, put any number of creature cards from your hand onto the
# battlefield." On turn 3 Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus, three Moxen and Sol Ring (8 mana). Its hand holds an Ornithopter and a Memnite, and Bot2's hand
# an Ornithopter too, which is not Bot1's to put (the Ornithopter Bot2 cast on turn 2 stays on its own battlefield and the one in its hand stays there).
# Bot1 takes both of its own: they are not cast (CR 608.2d), so the Memnite (a 1/1) and the Ornithopter arrive without mana. On turn 5 Ghalta attacks and
# Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocks it: with trample (CR 702.19b) 2 damage is assigned to the blocker and the other 10 to Bot2, 20 -> 10.

